{"id":433,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"心・国際・中高一貫の三つの教育","feature_description":"淑徳与野中学校は、高い品性を養う心の教育、豊かな感性を育む国際教育、輝く知性を身につける中高一貫教育を三つの柱としています。生徒一人ひとりが持つ可能性を伸ばし、将来の夢の実現を支援する方針です。心を磨くこと、多様な人や経験に触れて視野を広げること、専門分野の知識と幅広い教養を段階的に身につけることを掲げています。中学生向けの活動一覧では、運動部と文化部を分けて掲載しています。","clubs":[{"id":14010,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14011,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14012,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14013,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14014,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14015,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14016,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14017,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14018,"name":"E.S.S.部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14019,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14020,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.shukutoku.yono.saitama.jp/junior/camp/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14021,"name":"歴史研究部","category":"文化部","source_url